  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The data set was collected as an ongoing study at the Cape Bounty Arctic Watershed Observatory examining the environmental controls over spatial patterns of soil nitrogen availability in a High Arctic wet sedge meadow and how they influence trace gas release exchange processes. Results from this study will inform the net greenhouse gas balance of the wetland and how it may respond to climate change."
